    <section xml:id="ps15-section">
      <title>Problem Set 15</title>

      <subtitle>Polar Coordinates</subtitle>
      <introduction>
        <p>
          This problem set focuses on applications of integration in polar coordinates, including finding areas and arc lengths of polar curves.
        </p>

        <p>
          These problems will be scored on completion only.
        </p>
      </introduction>

